<h1>Audit</h1>
<p>Every action that changed anything, in the order it happened. Each entry
carries the hash of the one before it, so a line cannot be edited, removed or
back-dated without breaking the chain - and the chain is re-checked every time
this page loads.</p>
<p class="fine">Chain:
  <span class="chip st-done">verified</span>
  across <b><N></b> events. Newest first.
  This is what makes a stamped deliverable defensible months later: not that
  somebody remembers approving it, but that the record says who did, when, and
  what the figures were at the time.</p>

